{"id":"32c9990061b9749d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-implication.md","title":"Modal Implication","display":"df-modal-implication — Modal Implication","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-implication","aliases":["89-df-modal-implication"],"display":"df-modal-implication — Modal Implication","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-implication"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-implication</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-implication — Modal Implication"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the modal-formula set from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}implication}\\vdash\n\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad(A,B)\\longmapsto\\neg(A\\land\\neg B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}implication}\\vdash\n\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad(A,B)\\longmapsto\\neg(A\\land\\neg B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>模态蕴含的定义</li>\n<li>蕴含通过否定和合取定义</li>\n<li>这是模态逻辑的基本性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ is the modal-formula set from\n[[89-df-modal-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}implication}\\vdash\n\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box},\n\\qquad(A,B)\\longmapsto\\neg(A\\land\\neg B).","display":true}],"bytes":674,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2ee1021448dc9af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Box:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and\n$\\to:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}^{2}\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ are the\nconstructors fixed in [[89-df-box-modality]] and\n[[89-df-modal-implication]]."},{"id":"40b00bc10cced0e5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f661762c12e8f92b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0218073c8db43619","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"483e9000e55f64a9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4c0998e9f7d64222","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-5","locations":